  "limitations": [
    "Academic local prototype; no emergency navigation or automatic acceptance as facts.",
    "No physical Android GPS/permission test; native channel and denial covered with doubles, Android build passed.",
    "Draft retained only during app session; no fully offline queue or restart recovery.",
    "One shared run per Manager; no private world per browser cookie.",
    "No high availability, automated backup, volume-loss recovery or restored simulation overlays.",
    "Public coordinates rounded to four decimals; 20 m is display quantization, not GPS accuracy or guaranteed anonymity.",
    "Later rejection does not revoke an applied overlay; it expires by simulation steps.",
    "No official ingestion, reporter identity, semantic PII detector or real corroboration.",
    "AWS deployment needs a writable persistent bind mount, authentication and backup decisions; existing root DeleteOnTermination is true."
  ],
